=== (1b) THE DECOMPOSITION — D is NOT symmetric, and reporting it as one number hides that ==
  bracket A — `abpoorw` (a HARDSHIP verdict): elective 0.6860 vs medical 0.3638   log-gap +0.6449
  bracket B — `abdefctw` (a MEDICAL verdict) : elective 0.4445 vs medical 0.4552   log-gap -0.0239
  D = A − B = +0.6449 − (-0.0239) = +0.6688
  ⚠ **96% of D comes from `abpoorw` alone.** The
     dissociation is ONE-SIDED: with its twin removed, `abdefctw` is nearly FLAT across all
     five remaining items. Reporting D as a symmetric double dissociation would be false.
  the mechanical reason, measured: only 29.5% call abortion-for-birth-defect wrong against 53.7% for abortion-for-poverty —
     the medical condemners are largely ABSOLUTISTS, and an absolutist's verdict carries no
     case information because he condemns every case. **A flat row is a person with a
     position, not a judgement about a case.**
  P(condemns poverty | condemns defect) = 0.934 vs P(condemns defect | condemns poverty) = 0.514

